   472 287E			.proc dli2
   473 287E 48					pha
   474 						
   475 						;We should only get here once. If we got here more than once, it
   476 						;means that an NMI was dispatched more than once, which is bad.
   477 						;It means that either the same DLI was dispatched more than once
   478 						;or that the DLI bit wasn't cleared at scanline 248.
   479 287F A5 C9				lda		d1
   480 2881 F0 30				beq		first_time
